@CodeEvolver.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5278

GET {{CodeEvolver.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{CodeEvolver.Api_HostAddress}}/api/service

### Pause new dispatch; active phases drain
POST {{CodeEvolver.Api_HostAddress}}/api/service/control
Content-Type: application/json

{"paused": true}

### Saved evolution summaries
GET {{CodeEvolver.Api_HostAddress}}/api/evolutions?summaries=true&offset=0

### Saved analysis history
GET {{CodeEvolver.Api_HostAddress}}/api/data-analysis
